    ("Kids' Footwear Size Chart", "https://www.nike.com/size-fit/kids-footwear", "Nike", "2026-11-11"),
    ("What Is Nike's Return Policy?", "https://www.nike.com/help/a/returns-policy", "Nike Help", "2026-11-11"),
