    ("Women's Footwear Size Chart", "https://www.nike.com/size-fit/womens-footwear", "Nike", "2026-11-11"),
    ("How To Measure Your Shoe Size and Foot Size at Home", "https://www.nike.com/a/how-to-measure-foot-size", "Nike", "2026-11-11"),
